# The first change a repo earns on a sockeye instance: a Checkfile, so
# its own push proves the runners end to end (Dan 9/28).
#
# bin/ is the shell nobody compiles. SC2029 stays excluded:
# vm-bootstrap passes "$user" and friends into a remote heredoc, and
# expanding them on the client side is how the values reach the box.
shellcheck: git ls-files -z '*.sh' 'bin/*' | xargs -0 shellcheck -e SC2029
